# Casino Neon (C4b, contract 41), 15 x 13, interior. column = i, row = j. The user's mock "Casino": a busy CARPET (ccarpet), two ROWS of slot machines (slot / slot_r, 16, each one `slots`),
# stools, two coin clerks (croupier, `coins_buy`: 50 coins for $1000), a hostess who tells the coins, three gamblers (jugador trainers) and a Vertice grunt who guards a POSTER on the west wall (the poster
# hides the switch of the villain hideout): beat him, read the poster, a switch clicks and the electric barrier in front of the hidden staircase (top right) goes down (flag 801). The stairs lead to the hideout (escondite_1).
@map casino_neon
@size 15 13
@interior yes
@area sala_juegos
@bg 0
@fill ccarpet
@spawn door 6 11 N
@spawn stairs 12 3 S
@flag poster_switch 801
@flag casino_grunt 802
@legend
  .  tile=ccarpet
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_i
  d  tile=ccarpet object=escalator
  e  tile=ccarpet object=slot interact=look script=slot_play
  f  tile=ccarpet object=slot_r interact=look script=slot_play
  g  tile=ccarpet npc=croupier id=clerk_a face=S script=coin_clerk
  h  tile=ccarpet door=escalator
  i  tile=ccarpet object=pillar
  j  tile=ccarpet npc=barrier id=barrier face=S behavior=turn period=500 text=casino.barrier hide_flag=801 gate=yes
  k  tile=ccarpet npc=jugador id=g2 face=S trainer=jugador_c2 range=2 text=tr.jugador_c2.pre after=tr.jugador_c2.after
  l  tile=ccarpet object=stool
  m  tile=ccarpet npc=jugador id=g1 face=W trainer=jugador_c1 range=3 text=tr.jugador_c1.pre after=tr.jugador_c1.after
  n  tile=ccarpet npc=vecino_m id=loser face=SE text=casino.npc.a
  o  tile=none object=wall_poster_i interact=look script=poster
  p  tile=ccarpet npc=croupier id=clerk_b face=E script=coin_clerk
  q  tile=ccarpet npc=dependienta id=hostess face=SW script=hostess
  r  tile=ccarpet npc=mama id=lady face=W text=casino.npc.b
  s  tile=ccarpet npc=vertice id=grunt face=E trainer=vertice_casino range=3 text=tr.vertice_casino.pre after=tr.vertice_casino.after beaten_flag=casino_grunt hide_flag=942   # C8 (contract 51): Director Varo disbands Vertice (flag 942, gimnasio_nodo.map): the grunt is gone
  t  tile=ccarpet npc=jugador id=g3 face=W trainer=jugador_c3 range=3 text=tr.jugador_c3.pre after=tr.jugador_c3.after
  u  tile=mat
@grid
  abbbbbbbbbbbbbb
  c............d.
  c.efef.g.fefehi
  c............j.
  c......k.......
  c.fefe...efef..
  c.llll...llllm.
  c..............
  c....n.........
  o..p.......q.r.
  cs.......t.....
  c..............
  c.....uu.......
@warp h -> escondite_1 spawn=up
@warp u -> metropolis_neon_2 spawn=casino_door

# The coin clerks: 50 coins for $1000; the casino plugin does the sale.
@script coin_clerk npc
    ask gl.c4c.coins.ask
    jv 0 1 yes
    say gl.c4c.coins.bye
    end
  yes:
    coins_buy 4
    jv 4 1 done
    jv 4 2 nomoney
    jv 4 3 nocase
    say gl.c4c.coins.full
    end
  done:
    sfx item
    say gl.c4c.coins.done
    end
  nomoney:
    say gl.shop.no_money
    end
  nocase:
    say gl.c4c.coins.nocase
@end
# The hostess tells how many coins the case holds (the Coin Purse is a key item from the diner).
@script hostess npc
    say casino.hostess.hi
    coins_get 5
    jv 5 0 none
    say gl.c4c.coins.have
    end
  none:
    say casino.hostess.none
@end
# Every machine: the slot screen (the screen says its own greetings; the script only answers the refusals).
@script slot_play interact
    slots 2
    jv 2 1 nocase
    jv 2 2 nocoins
    end
  nocase:
    say gl.c4c.coins.nocase
    end
  nocoins:
    say gl.c4c.coins.none
@end
# The poster. The grunt beside it stops the nosy; once he is beaten the switch shows and the barrier of the hidden stairs goes down.
@script poster interact
    jf poster_switch again
    jf casino_grunt found
    npc_face_hero grunt
    say casino.poster.stop
    end
  found:
    say casino.poster.look
    say casino.poster.switch
    sfx confirm
    setf poster_switch
    npc_hide barrier
    wait 400
    say casino.poster.clack
    end
  again:
    say casino.poster.after
@end
